  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-Black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Consumptive Replication</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/37/Meruem%27s_aura_synthesis.png/revision/latest?cb=20160711121934\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Meruem&#39;s aura synthesis\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/37/Meruem%27s_aura_synthesis.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20160711121934\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/37/Meruem%27s_aura_synthesis.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20160711121934 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/37/Meruem%27s_aura_synthesis.png/revision/latest?cb=20160711121934 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Meruem&#39;s aura synthesis\" width=\"270\" height=\"296\" data-image-key=\"Meruem%27s_aura_synthesis.png\" data-image-name=\"Meruem&#39;s aura synthesis.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">By consuming users of Nen, Meruem (Hunter × Hunter) was able to assimilate their aura and powers, adding it to his own.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Gain others' powers through consumption.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>gain the powers of others by consuming them.</b> Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Consumption_Mimicry\" title=\"Consumption Mimicry\">Consumption Mimicry</a>. Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Biological_Absorption\" title=\"Biological Absorption\">Biological Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FConsumptive_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user is able to obtain powers by consuming/absorbing the owners of said powers or a piece of them.(the user will not obtain powers that are negative in nature like weakness and the user is immune to any negative effect or consequences of what he eats i.e like if the food is poisonous)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FConsumptive_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Consumption_Empowerment\" title=\"Consumption Empowerment\">Consumption Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Consumption_Mimicry\" title=\"Consumption Mimicry\">Consumption Mimicry</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FConsumptive_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Haemopotent_Replication\" title=\"Haemopotent Replication\">Haemopotent Replication</a>: The user gains powers by ingesting blood.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Absorption\" title=\"Soul Absorption\">Soul Absorption</a>: The user gains powers by absorbing the souls of their previous owners.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FConsumptive_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Biological_Absorption\" title=\"Biological Absorption\">Biological Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Consumption_Shapeshifting\" title=\"Consumption Shapeshifting\">Consumption Shapeshifting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Digestive_Assimilation\" title=\"Digestive Assimilation\">Digestive Assimilation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Entity_Absorption\" title=\"Entity Absorption\">Entity Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FConsumptive_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>See also: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/CannibalismSuperpower\">Cannibalism Superpower</a></i>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"scrollable\" style=\"overflow:auto; max-height:275px; width:100%; -moz-border-radius-topleft:0.5em; border:1px solid #AAAAAA; padding-left:0.5em; background:transparent;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://attackontitan.fandom.com/wiki/Titans\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:attackontitan:Titans\">Titans</a> (<i>Attack on Titan</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://attackontitan.fandom.com/wiki/Titan_Shifter\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:attackontitan:Titan Shifter\">Titan Shifters</a> (<i>Attack on Titan</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://guyver.fandom.com/wiki/Aptom\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:guyver:Aptom\">Aptom</a> (<i>Bio Booster Armor Guyver</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bleach.fandom.com/wiki/Aaroniero_Arruruerie\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:blea